"parts":[{"text":"வேந்தர்","lemma":"வேந்தன்","gloss":"kings"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"dative suffix"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"to the kings indeed"},{"surface":"அரிதே","parts":[{"text":"அரிது","lemma":"அரிது","gloss":"difficult thing"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is difficult indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீலத்து","parts":[{"text":"நீலத்து","lemma":"நீலத்து","gloss":"of the blue water-lily"}],"gloss":"of the blue water-lily","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இணை","parts":[{"text":"இணை","lemma":"இணை","gloss":"pair"}],"gloss":"paired"},{"surface":"மலர்","parts":[{"text":"மலர்","lemma":"மலர்","gloss":"flower"}],"gloss":"flowers"},{"surface":"புரையும்","parts":[{"text":"புரை","lemma":"புரை","gloss":"resemble"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"resembling"},{"surface":"உண்கண்","parts":[{"text":"உண்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"kohl-dyed"},{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"}],"gloss":"kohl-lined eyes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கிணை","parts":[{"text":"கிணை","lemma":"கிணை","gloss":"kiṇai drum"}],"gloss":"kiṇai drum"},{"surface":"மகட்கு","parts":[{"text":"மகள்","lemma":"மகள்","gloss":"daughter"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"dative suffix"}],"gloss":"to the daughter"},{"surface":"எளிதால்","parts":[{"text":"எளிது","lemma":"எளிது","gloss":"easy thing"},{"text":"ஆல்","lemma":"ஆல்","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is easy indeed"},{"surface":"பாடினள்","parts":[{"text":"பாடு","lemma":"பாடு","gloss":"sing"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"அள்","gloss":"feminine singular suffix"}],"gloss":"she sang"},{"surface":"வரினே","parts":[{"text":"வரின்","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"if she comes"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"if she comes"}]}],"literal":"Pitiable indeed is itself, the great dark hill! / Conquering with spears, to the kings indeed, is difficult; / Resembling a pair of blue water-lily flowers, kohl-lined eyes, / to the daughter of the drummer, is easy indeed, if she comes singing.","translation":"Pitiable indeed is this great, dark hill! To conquer it with spears is impossible for the kings. Yet, it is so easy for the daughter of a drummer with kohl-lined eyes resembling a pair of blue water-lilies, if she comes singing.","modern":"மிகப் பெரிய கரிய இந்தப் பறம்பு மலை இரங்கத்தக்கது! மூவேந்தர்கள் வேல் கொண்டு போரிட்டு இதனை வெல்வது மிகவும் அரிது. ஆனால், இரண்டு நீல மலர்களைப் போன்ற மை தீட்டிய கண்களைக் கொண்ட கிணைப் பறையடிக்கும் பாணனின் மகள் பாடிக்கொண்டு வந்தால், அவளுக்கு இந்த மலையைப் பெறுவது மிகவும் எளிது.","explanation":"This poem is sung by the poet Kapilar about Vēḷ Pāri's Parambu hill, belonging to the Nochchi tiṇai (defending a fort) and the theme of refusing a daughter's hand to besieging kings. Kapilar addresses the three crowned kings who have besieged Parambu hill to capture it. He mockingly tells them that conquering this great dark hill with their spears is impossible. However, the hill is easily won by a simple drummer's daughter with beautiful eyes resembling blue water-lilies, if she merely comes singing. Through this contrast, Kapilar highlights Pāri's immense generosity to artists and the futility of the kings' military might.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.92],[0.92,1.55],[1.55,1.8],[1.8,2.5],[2.5,2.7],[2.7,3.47],[3.47,3.8],[3.8,4.67],[4.67,5.1],[5.1,5.3],[5.3,5.6],[5.6,6.1],[6.1,6.6],[6.6,6.85],[6.85,7.1],[7.1,7.84],[7.84,8.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.87],[0.87,1.4],[1.5,1.8],[1.9,2.5],[2.5,3.1],[3.1,3.83],[3.9,4.3],[4.3,5.9],[5.9,6.1],[6.1,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,7.2],[7.2,7.53],[7.53,8.19],[8.19,8.85],[8.85,9.51],[9.51,10.0]]},"sync":[[["அளிதோ","pitiable indeed"]],[["தானே","itself"]],[["பேரிருங்","great dark"]],[["குன்றே","hill"]],[["வேலின்","with spears"]],[["வேறல்","conquering"]],[["வேந்தர்க்கோ","to the kings indeed"]],[["அரிதே","is difficult indeed"]],[["நீலத்து","of the blue water-lily"]],[["இணை","paired"]],[